# Ownership and review of the sensitive paths of this repository.
# "Require review from Code Owners" is deliberately off in the branch
# protection: there is a single maintainer, and GitHub does not let an
# author approve their own pull request. This file documents ownership,
# requests a review on pull requests from outside contributors, and is the
# hook for turning the requirement on once a second reviewer appears.
#
# The last matching line wins; the owner is the same everywhere.

